  <section class="lab-definition">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">The short answer</div>
      <h2>What is B2B sales training and coaching?</h2>
      <p><strong>B2B sales training builds the skills sellers need to create, develop, and advance conversations with business buyers. Sales coaching turns those skills into better behavior inside real selling situations.</strong></p>
      <p>That includes prospecting, cold calling, email and LinkedIn outreach, discovery, listening, value communication, objection handling, qualification, follow-up, negotiation behavior, and securing a clear next step.</p>
      <p>Sales Execution Lab connects the training room to the field. Your team learns what good looks like, practices it, applies it, reviews what happened, and improves again.</p>
      <div class="lab-truth-line">Knowing the script is not the skill. Executing when the buyer pushes back is the skill.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

