    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">The execution gap</div>
      <h2>Your team can know the methodology and still lose the moment.</h2>
      <p>A rep knows they should ask questions. Then the prospect challenges the price and the rep starts defending. A founder knows discovery matters. Then they spend twelve minutes explaining the product. An SDR knows follow-up matters. Then the next email says, “Just checking in.”</p>
      <p>The gap is rarely a total lack of knowledge. It is the ability to recall, adapt, and execute the right behavior while the conversation is moving.</p>
      <div class="punch">Sales Execution Lab works on the moment the buyer actually experiences.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

